        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "03 · WHAT",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 1680
        },
        {
          "role": "title",
          "content": "从简报到交付的四步流水线",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 1680
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "脑暴",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "结构化问题冻结需求，不边做边问。",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "生成",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "主题冻结后落码，逐页一个视觉重心。",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "双闸验收",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "渲染校验查溢出，容量门禁查超载。",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "导出",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "双轨 PPTX：可编辑轨与保真轨并行。",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 351
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "content": "每一步都有机器可验的出口标准——不达标就停下修，不带着问题进下一步。",
          "line_count": 1,
          "advance_width": 1680
        },
